  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Stephen Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:06:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:06:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Stephen Gardiner. I have a couch I need to put out. Old sofa. How do I do that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:06:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you're breaking up a little. You have a couch you want to get rid of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:06:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. A couch. For bulk pickup. [line breaks up] Is there a fee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:06:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bulk items like that usually need to be scheduled ahead, and there can be a fee depending on the item. Let me get your address and I'll set it up. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:06:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "231 Chapel Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:07:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "231 Chapel. Is that on Historic Hill, up past the church?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:07:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the one. Sorry, I'm outside. I was up early to watch the parade rehearsal and the signal's bad here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:07:13-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I can hear you okay now. So, one couch, curbside at 231 Chapel. I'll put in the request and the crew will tell you the pickup day and what the charge is, if there is one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Should I put it out now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:07:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait until you have the date. Put it out the night before, not sooner. Do you want a callback number in case we need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:07:39-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0168."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:07:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0168. You're all set, Mr. Gardiner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T12:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
